# The Recorder taken to the Governor in Paseo (story_lab_b1.json, the
# Recorder in Rolf's bag, moved to under the tower's door). The desk
# (Building_CentralTowerOutside) sends it straight up: $0D04. The Governor
# (loc_C9BE, ps2.asm:18476): CheckItemExistInventory finds it, $1107, and
# event_routine + 2 is loc_CA22 -- the library, by screen_changed_flag.
# The library (loc_C3E6, 17946): Rolf alive and the Recorder found, $1010
# and on to the graph (loc_C49A), $1012, PaletteLoad2 $32, $1013; then
# loc_C4CA removes the Recorder and adds ItemID_KeyTube to the same
# member's bag, with SXFID_ItemReceived. Reported missing by the player
# on an earlier build; this pins the path as it plays now.

start slot 1 routes/saves/paseo_recorder.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 4 32 17
expect item Recorder 0
walk up 2
wait screen building
wait idle
expect script $0D04          # the desk: "This must get to the governor!"
press c
wait idle
expect script $1107
shot 01_governor
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect script $1108
expect script $1109
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect script $1010          # the library: the Recorder played
expect script $1011
expect script $1012
shot 02_graph
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c                      # the last of $1014: loc_C4CA
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 4 32 16
expect item KeyTube 0        # the Recorder out, the Key Tube in Rolf's hands
shot 03_key_tube
expect no-stderr not ported
